WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
A dish holds a small colony of bacteria.

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.320
It adds a few cells a minute.

3
00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.320
Later the colony is large, and
it adds many cells a minute.

4
00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:11.470
Same dish, same food.

5
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.650
The only difference is
size: the bigger the colony,

6
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.660
the faster it grows.

7
00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.510
That is a sentence.

8
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.770
Mathematics needs an equation.

9
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.470
What equation says it?

10
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.870
In this mission, you'll turn sentences
about rates of change into differential

11
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:28.070
equations.

12
00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:32.630
You'll solve them by separating the
variables and integrating each side.

13
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.660
And you'll draw slope fields: a
short segment at each grid point,

14
00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.350
with the gradient there.

15
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.150
Your mission: find the equation for a
population that grows in proportion to its

16
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:43.890
size.
